regel-screensaver (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian release. (Closes: #1000000)
  * 7 procedural audio-reactive visual archetypes.
  * Safe Rust PipeWire audio analyzer and physics engine.
  * Native Qt 6 RHI SPIR-V shader pipeline.
  * Plasma 6 wallpaper containment and kscreenlocker integration.

